 **Data Structures**
-*   **Material Grid**: A 3D array storing integer material IDs at voxel centers.
-*   **Face List**: A list of quadrilateral faces. Each face is defined by four vertices and stores two material tags (one for each adjacent voxel).
-*   **Vertex Map**: A mapping from geometric positions to topological vertices. Vertices may be split to handle non-manifold topology.
